1
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:16,393
Old Wives’ Tales are those ‘helpful’ things that your grandparents say that are probably not true.

2
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:32,009
They are things like, ‘If you watch a lot of TV, you’ll get square eyes’, ‘If you eat carrots, you’ll see well in the dark’, or ‘If you eat cheese at night, you’ll have bad dreams’.

3
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:38,290
But are they nonsense or is there sometimes a little bit of truth in them?

4
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:41,157
We decided to investigate more.

5
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:48,054
Let’s start with a famous one: ‘An apple a day keeps the doctor away’.

6
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,860
My grandma said this all the time.

7
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:57,017
Well, of course everyone knows that fruit is an important part of a healthy diet.

8
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,440
But can one apple really make a difference?

9
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:04,940
A medical study from 2013 says ‘yes’.

10
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:14,920
It found that if people over 50 eat an apple a day, their chances of a heart attack are much smaller than people who don’t.

11
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:19,800
What about ‘Gain a child, lose a tooth’?

12
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:25,200
They say that when a woman has a child, a tooth will fall out.

13
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:39,149
Researchers at the New York University College of Dentistry studied more than 2,600 women between the ages of 18 and 64 with one or more children.

14
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:40,995
And guess what?

15
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:49,529
They found they had more problems with their teeth than women with no children, although they couldn’t say exactly why.

16
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:55,682
My great uncle was a big believer that ‘fish is brain food’.

17
00:01:56,540 --> 00:02:00,300
He ate it all the time and he was a clever man, too.

18
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,344
It looks like he might be right.

19
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:09,416
Fish have a lot of omega-3 and omega-6 fats in their oil.

20
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:23,820
Some scientists from Oxford studied 120 primary school children, and they discovered that the children who ate omega-3 and omega-6 made big improvements in their schoolwork.

21
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:29,513
If you eat fish oil, it will help to prevent heart problems, too.

22
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:33,380
It seems like eating fish is a good idea.

23
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,380
Finally, what about those carrots?

24
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:40,485
Can they really help your night vision?

25
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:45,790
I’ve eaten them all my life, but I still walk into things when I get up in the night.

26
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:51,909
Unfortunately, I can’t find anything to prove if this is right or wrong.

27
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:56,340
I’ll keep looking and I’ll let you know as soon as I find out.
